### Send Chat Message
POST http://localhost:8081/api/chat/send
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientName": "Receptionist",
  "hospitalName": "General Hospital",
  "roleCode": "ROLE_RECEPTIONIST",
  "content": "Hello! Can you review the patient's record?"
}


### Mark messages as read
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/chat/mark-read/f0bf57a2-fa04-40bf-ad72-f0b4cb610d90/10d65215-0721-40f1-8af3-6102171417cb
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### Get all conversations for user6 (Receptionist)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/chat/conversations/f0bf57a2-fa04-40bf-ad72-f0b4cb610d90?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get paginated chat history between receptionist and hospital admin
GET http://localhost:8081/api/chat/history/f0bf57a2-fa04-40bf-ad72-f0b4cb610d90/10d65215-0721-40f1-8af3-6102171417cb?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Search messages in chat history (keyword: "review")
GET http://localhost:8081/api/chat/history/f0bf57a2-fa04-40bf-ad72-f0b4cb610d90/10d65215-0721-40f1-8af3-6102171417cb/search?keyword=review&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get all messages for user6 (Receptionist inbox)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/chat/messages/f0bf57a2-fa04-40bf-ad72-f0b4cb610d90?unread=false&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

